  "img": "icons/svg/statue.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>You know how to get exactly where you need to be, when you need to be there.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers/Qualities</div><p>Assign one of the dice you rolled at the end of the power source step to the @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle} power or a power from the Mobility category. If you already have at least one, either skip it or swap this die with one of your new dice.</p><p>Assign one or more remaining dice to any of these powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle}</p><p>• Select from Athletic powers category</p><p>• Select from Mobility powers category</p><p>• Select from Psychic powers category</p><p>• Select from Technological powers category</p><p>Assign any remaining dice to any of these qualities:</p><p>• Select from Physical qualities category</p><p>• Select from Social qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of the following Green abilities, using two different powers.</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.YRedgGF4MwRihDPh]{Displacement Assault}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.5OtnGe7R4OoOjfck]{Hit & Run}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.m1MJKmpisIGMKatS]{Mobile Assist}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.s1cfEPIftrbKiRv5]{Mobile Dodge}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.QrX70BABFgW8K5q4]{Run Down}</li></ul><p>Gain one of the above abilities as a Yellow ability.</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.QqU1ALV6yCPxFAdq]{Displacement Assault}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.RAOrs4cIuVH8WNCv]{Hit & Run}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.jgsx052iAprqogaC]{Mobile Assist}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.i5MSZbAhwHhFovFt]{Mobile Dodge}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.0afn9nJrtrdEU3ox]{Run Down}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose an Expertise principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Personality</div><p>Roll d10, d10 for personality selection.</p></section>"
